WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
The stator stays still. Its three-phase winding creates a rotating magnetic field.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Use one hundred and twenty times frequency divided by total pole count.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Fifty hertz with four poles gives one thousand five hundred revolutions per minute for the rotating field.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
In motoring operation the rotor runs below synchronous speed. No motor-specific shaft speed is measured or claimed.
